          "note": "Latin /kt/ > /pt/."
        },
        {
          "from": "Latin coxa 'hip'",
          "to": "Romanian coapsă 'thigh'",
          "note": "/ks/ > [ps] after a rounded vowel (cf. laxare > lăsa); compare Dalmatian copsa."
